fferent starting decks and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of different cards and artifacts to discover and combine to annihilate your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability and never-ending combos to uncover</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Mini Tank Mayhem is a roguelike deck-building tower defense game where you command a powerful mini-tank to repel waves of alien invaders. Craft your very own deck, deploy strategic defenses, and unleash devastating combos to protect Earth from pesky aliens!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, German, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "reviews": "“Mini Tank Mayhem is one of the most exciting and tense tower-defense titles that I have played.”<br>9 – Gamegrin<br><br>“Mini Tank Mayhem is an interesting game because of how it combines a lot of familiar things, rather than doing any specific thing that's groundbreaking. It means it's really easy to pick up and play as long as you're familiar with any deck-building and any tower defence game, and having knowledge of both can really help. It's a lot of fun to play and well worth checking out.”<br>8 – TheSixthAxis<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/9623087d41b4900569a7e0d00a0b266fc2efa563/header.jpg?t=1784252162", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/abcc364cff2a11f9c179f839e1125e8c19ab6ab5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784252162", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/abcc364cff2a11f9c179f839e1125e8c19ab6ab5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784252162", "website": "https://algo.rocks/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Proce